<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 14.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire and Northamptonshire Feb 111.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Shropshire Mar 95.00</p>
<p>		  Devon Feb 93.50/94.00</p>
<p>		  Suffolk/Essex Mar 96.00/96.50</p>
<p>		  Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 95.50/96.00</p>
<p>		  Avon range Apr/Jun 98.50</p>
<p>		  Cambridgeshire Feb 93.00</p>
</text>
